      "message": "\u003e 1 of 43 TryBots failed.\n\u003e Failed on linux-amd64 (Go 1.19.x): https://storage.googleapis.com/go-build-log/c9d5dd54/linux-amd64_c2796e39.log\n\u003e\n\u003e ```\n\u003e :: Running go1.19.x test -short ./... in x509roots/fallback\n\u003e go: warning: \"./...\" matched no packages\n\u003e no packages to test\n\u003e (exit code 1)\n\u003e ```\n\nThis was a false positive failure due to a known x/build issue #52287.\nPatch set 2 adds a small, temporary workaround that is only needed while Go 1.19 is still supported by https://go.dev/doc/devel/release#policy. (CC @bcmills@google.com.)",
